<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Petrobras net profit up in 1996.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Petrobras net profit up in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state oil monopoly Petrobras, known formally as Petroleo Brasileiro S.A., has released the following 1996 earnings figures.</p>
<p>			  1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Net		 664 million	  570 million</p>
<p>    Shr		 6.12		   N/A</p>
<p>    Gross Rev	 23.822 bln	   18.768 bln</p>
<p>    Net Revs	  16.872 bln	   13.945 bln</p>
<p>Note: The figures are all in Brazilian reais and are not inflation-adjusted. Share net is per lot of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413))</p>
</text>
